 HOW TO RUN----------
  First, Download the Microbix_Editor.py in Desktop. Make sure you have python installed!
  Second, Add the clips you want to edit, (EX: DJI_001). Make sure it supports or errors will appear.
  Third, Run CMD in certain Directory you have placed the files in, run the program by typing:
  python Microbix_Editor.py
  Fourth, After running the program will ask you for clip file names (MAKE SURE THE CLIPS ARE IN THE SAME DIRECTORY AS THE PROGRAM),  
Make sure your file name is exactly matching the file name that you will paste, Add as many files as you want, once done,
 Type START, and the program will run. Sit back and relax!

